                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/253: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-29T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>279. Your 464, November 28, 4 P.M.</p>
                <p>With whom and on what basis was protest filed?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
